                   ['Of the real cases, how many does it catch?', 'Each miss costs a loss'],
                   ['Of its alarms, how many are real?', 'Each false alarm costs work and goodwill'],
                   ['Measured on which cases: learned-from, kept aside, or ours?', 'Only unseen and own cases are fair'],
                   ['How does it compare with doing nothing, and with our current rule?', 'A tool must beat the simple option'],
